		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Scales and horns of gleaming, colorful crystal and wings that shine like stained glass. Precise, rigid, demanding, and aloof.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 57, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend +8 (2d8) or 1 thunder breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (burrow, fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> L, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Scintillating Hide</strong>. Lightning immune. 1:6 chance hostile spells are reflected back at their originator.</p><p></p><p><strong>Thunder Breath</strong>. A double near-size cube of pealing thunder extending from dragon. CON 15+ or 5d4 damage and deafened 1d6 rounds.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
